            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PHOENIX HEAT LAB</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">World's largest case study</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">2023 RECORDS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">31 straight days above 110°F</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">123°F tied all-time high</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">645+ heat deaths</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"400\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">ADAPTATION</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">• Cool pavement program</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"545\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">• Tree canopy 1,000+</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">• Cooling centers, alerts</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"620\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">2050 PROJECTION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">100+ days at 110°F</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">vs ~21 days today</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"840\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">PHOENIX = THE CANARY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"945\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">More cities face same conditions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"990\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">First US city Office of Heat Response</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Phoenix as a real-time stress test"
