            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Why heat is deadliest</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"200\" width=\"940\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WET-BULB LIMIT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">>35°C: sweat evaporation fails</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Even healthy people can die</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Hours of exposure → death</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"460\" width=\"940\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">REGIONAL + CUMULATIVE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Affects everyone in a region</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"610\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Multi-day cumulative damage</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"655\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Indoor or out, no AC = same risk</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"720\" width=\"940\" height=\"300\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">SCALE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">2003 EU: 70,000 deaths in 2 weeks</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"870\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">More than 20th-c US tornado record</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Hurricanes: ~10s-1000s</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"975\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Heat: 10,000s-100,000s routinely</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Heat kills at unparalleled scale"
