" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Loss & Damage (COP27)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Tech transfer, climate finance</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"965\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Justice = political feasibility</text></svg>",
