" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Project Drawdown rankings</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">High impact vs busywork</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"900\" width=\"940\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"955\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">SYNTHESIS, NOT MEMORIZATION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Use what you already know</text></svg>",
