"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Tropical forest restoration</text><text x=\"950\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"22\">~85 Gt</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Cheap, biodiversity co-benefits</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"640\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Educating girls + family planning</text><text x=\"950\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"22\">~85 Gt</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"720\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Not peripheral — central</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"755\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Plant-rich diets</text><text x=\"950\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"22\">~78 Gt</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"835\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Less beef/dairy = biggest dietary lever</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"870\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Refrigerant management</text><text x=\"950\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"22\">~57 Gt</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"950\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">HFCs: 1000-3000× CO₂</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"985\" width=\"940\" height=\"55\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1022\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">Let evidence pick the actions</text></svg>",
            "caption": "The actual top of the climate-solution list"
