"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Use offsets as substitute</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Dismiss personal action entirely</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"920\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"975\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">BOTH / AND</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1015\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Personal + civic, evidence-led</text></svg>",
